sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant RecipeImport as RecipeImport
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+RecipeImport: recordRecipe(resultingRecipeId)
    Note over RecipeImport: Policies: recipeImportRead, recipeImportWrite, recipeImportExecute
    Note over RecipeImport: Guards (4)
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;finalizing#quot;
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[1]: self.finalizationStartedAt != null
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[3]: self.resultingRecipe != null
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: mutate.resultingRecipeId
    RecipeImport->>EventBus: emit RecipeImportRecipeRecorded on recipe_import.recipe_recorded
    RecipeImport-->>-Client: void